#. module: base_search_relevant
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:base_search_relevant.field_search_relevant_config__append_only
msgid ""
"Index new records only. The freshness pass then walks by id, which reads the"
" primary key instead of scanning the whole table for recent writes. On a "
"table of millions of rows, like the chatter, that scan is most of what the "
"index costs. The price: a change to a record already indexed is not picked "
"up, and its old text keeps matching until the model is re-indexed."
msgstr ""

